WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.180
«nous avons»: we have.

2
00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:04.330
«nous savons»: we know.

3
00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:07.830
Listen again. They're
one tiny sound apart.

4
00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.970
Then look at «grand» and «petit».

5
00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:12.520
The last letter is written,

6
00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:14.060
but it just sits there.

7
00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:18.300
So why do so many French words
end in letters nobody says?

8
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.120
And what wakes them up again?

9
00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.950
In this mission, you'll watch
ghost letters fade in and out.

10
00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:27.290
Then you'll watch two short
words squeeze into one,

11
00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:29.250
with an apostrophe in the gap.

12
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:33.360
Your mission: find out when a
silent letter comes back to life,

13
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.320
and what it sounds like when it does.
